      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/greenwood_wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Mormon loggers once worked near Greenwood in 1844, floating white pine logs downriver for a temple in Nauvoo, Illinois.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
